      "title": "The River Lantern's Last Song",
      "node": "WD_TAVERN",
      "npc": "C14",
      "opening": "Rain drums on the Waterdeep windows. Maris Thorne sets down a glass as a traveler's star-chart sputters and a violet eye flickers in the reflection. The cellar door rattles.",
      "dialogue": "'Either that cellar is haunted, or somebody has opened a very expensive hole in reality. Drinks are still half-price until the screaming starts.'",
